{
  "lessons": [
    {
      "lessonId": "etcl-01-talking-about-my-job",
      "manifestSha256": "ba874340d1437b32b93a2ca754bc4490c86d2ac18bcfce9987f76578ec877763",
      "entries": [
        {
          "phraseIndex": 0,
          "en": "I'm mainly focused on developing my own apps.",
          "ja": "私は主に自分のアプリ開発に取り組んでいます。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-01-talking-about-my-job/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-001.mp3",
          "size": 64896,
          "sha256": "6a124b5af6647812e06ad1eea614faab3c15ad0480a80f87502196be5044d56e"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 1,
          "en": "I do food delivery on the side.",
          "ja": "副業でフードデリバリーをしています。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-01-talking-about-my-job/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-002.mp3",
          "size": 48768,
          "sha256": "6cbed6a385d507b81f6980e4f68f5bb228af850991948eec05c972e0cde3ee45"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 2,
          "en": "I like the flexibility.",
          "ja": "その自由度の高さが気に入っています。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-01-talking-about-my-job/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-003.mp3",
          "size": 67200,
          "sha256": "40e72920d72c88c7d4cc2c9b03505ebb48e41f336bd666f89c0cdd619e96a795"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 3,
          "en": "It gives me more time to work on my own projects.",
          "ja": "そのおかげで、自分のプロジェクトに取り組む時間が増えます。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-01-talking-about-my-job/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-004.mp3",
          "size": 72960,
          "sha256": "9b239d3fe0bb56c77c7fc44a4d85d2da31c262f781a9aed1dccbc707eab56a81"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 4,
          "en": "Eventually, I'd like to make money from my apps.",
          "ja": "いずれは自分のアプリで収入を得たいです。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-01-talking-about-my-job/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-005.mp3",
          "size": 61824,
          "sha256": "da7e025dd5ad901e4abe9cef015875888a154402fca29dbbbcd6cee29e0e93d7"
        }
      ],
      "originalManifestSha256": "3ef3af0e3df76051477a5537d124c707299d31e833f276c51e94cb34f5d98aff"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "etcl-02-daily-routine",
      "manifestSha256": "4bc80cd75907715b32b3ba1a4e3419ca48c446a1e958bb45c77fe292e5c96ba4",
      "entries": [
        {
          "phraseIndex": 0,
          "en": "My schedule changes from day to day.",
          "ja": "私のスケジュールは日によって変わります。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-02-daily-routine/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-001.mp3",
          "size": 56832,
          "sha256": "14290dbf683fd38af61c557c8f249919afd831fafffad6c91fea28d335ed34c8"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 1,
          "en": "I work on my apps between deliveries.",
          "ja": "配達の合間に自分のアプリを開発しています。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-02-daily-routine/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-002.mp3",
          "size": 74496,
          "sha256": "bd349316bce5c23c41d8924411e9058a758e52c486e5f08668d8039742182ccb"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 2,
          "en": "I try to make the most of my downtime.",
          "ja": "空き時間をできるだけ有効に使うようにしています。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-02-daily-routine/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-003.mp3",
          "size": 72960,
          "sha256": "da5620f63fdb34e84ecc76dd33f5f546734a83323655d5110b5df341f149dbd4"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 3,
          "en": "I practice English while making deliveries.",
          "ja": "配達をしながら英語を練習しています。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-02-daily-routine/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-004.mp3",
          "size": 57600,
          "sha256": "7ba829157036efbf6d63f4b8f580ea4d384333f4818a3f3f84124c6ed6ee676e"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 4,
          "en": "I try to make time for exercise as well.",
          "ja": "運動する時間も確保するようにしています。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-02-daily-routine/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-005.mp3",
          "size": 59520,
          "sha256": "a299c0ae7de3b6cafb5cb1d556f32f323f9bd04ba14c06fa817b1be82911f970"
        }
      ],
      "originalManifestSha256": "ba9848f4027fc1369bdc4a28200ee612e6d9ddefb244743b0547205d48bbe777"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "etcl-03-recent-events",
      "manifestSha256": "ca64126138555994be733e57a150ce39b821f78e8029ebf176e39eb677101903",
      "entries": [
        {
          "phraseIndex": 0,
          "en": "I ran into a bug the other day.",
          "ja": "この前、バグに遭遇しました。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-03-recent-events/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-001.mp3",
          "size": 51456,
          "sha256": "85227b3f0e31e9db860af17bbe5ef8cc7513f99d1abde8a265ab2215aa7092d4"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 1,
          "en": "I was working on a new feature when part of the app suddenly stopped working.",
          "ja": "新しい機能を開発していたら、突然アプリの一部が動かなくなりました。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-03-recent-events/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-002.mp3",
          "size": 96000,
          "sha256": "0574c733d4faefc7928768980708738eecf1a0cc69741abe26cc28bbff2d76a4"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 2,
          "en": "I used AI to help me figure out what was causing the problem.",
          "ja": "問題の原因を突き止めるためにAIを使いました。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-03-recent-events/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-003.mp3",
          "size": 78720,
          "sha256": "0ebde3d9d892158cdb2c19ba39a4f398d3c8ca9dce2e747750dd07448270210d"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 3,
          "en": "It helped me narrow down the cause.",
          "ja": "そのおかげで原因を絞り込むことができました。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-03-recent-events/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-004.mp3",
          "size": 70656,
          "sha256": "0276c84818b813291314c86c39dcf1cc9fb2eb07a17394e2e624d03774a45172"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 4,
          "en": "I was able to fix it.",
          "ja": "それを修正することができました。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-03-recent-events/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-005.mp3",
          "size": 50688,
          "sha256": "7420df21a0998dbd1a9685cc937c9f9316106804892d94cb57c112f8f65f6eaf"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 5,
          "en": "It took longer than I expected, but I learned a lot from it.",
          "ja": "予想以上に時間がかかりましたが、そこから多くのことを学びました。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-03-recent-events/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-006.mp3",
          "size": 88320,
          "sha256": "ebd38a152a62f71ef1b59a54376b12876f0154eaa58eb7e24938878a2ce3032f"
        }
      ],
      "originalManifestSha256": "f05c69642047bc0461955d47fa4a5c4a9a0a2c83cf8faad5fc51120ad262c1cc"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "etcl-04-current-situation",
      "manifestSha256": "e1ddd520755b118de37588857ff8153b0ea4dde17780eeb5e9c1dd0a79f56d4a",
      "entries": [
        {
          "phraseIndex": 0,
          "en": "I've been practicing English regularly with an app I built.",
          "ja": "自分で作ったアプリを使って、定期的に英語を練習しています。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-04-current-situation/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-001.mp3",
          "size": 82560,
          "sha256": "968e3808b96a3bdd55f60e84ad077bb060e07e7b0965fc4b65f78f841cd77a0d"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 1,
          "en": "I can come up with phrases I've practiced much more quickly now.",
          "ja": "練習したフレーズが、今では以前よりずっと早く思い浮かびます。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-04-current-situation/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-002.mp3",
          "size": 84096,
          "sha256": "45f121e9a1e7e6ff70b2d37d94b0d01486c3dc79f68b301a9eb8a07ff8a6def2"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 2,
          "en": "I'm starting to understand more spoken English than before.",
          "ja": "以前よりも、話されている英語を理解できるようになってきました。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-04-current-situation/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-003.mp3",
          "size": 74496,
          "sha256": "14e6386fc3c0e0b4e770400bcb0a4602127c0e0dbe129a28493ceccf8e03a343"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 3,
          "en": "I still find it difficult to speak freely without relying on memorized phrases.",
          "ja": "暗記したフレーズに頼らずに自由に話すのは、まだ難しいと感じます。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-04-current-situation/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-004.mp3",
          "size": 99456,
          "sha256": "b101ea507d304de7b77068e7c123655a59bdfe417509d51d7f92e7505627adff"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 4,
          "en": "I still have a long way to go.",
          "ja": "まだまだ先は長いです。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-04-current-situation/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-005.mp3",
          "size": 39168,
          "sha256": "67fd751f48bf7760b064d20576fe6f4e15b21ae8a086e69633e82671632c1bc3"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 5,
          "en": "I feel like I'm making progress.",
          "ja": "上達していると感じます。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-04-current-situation/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-006.mp3",
          "size": 54528,
          "sha256": "45fc93dd03c01f8db73b56a60bc2147d7ef6fe7df75be34e966581ffa8094fba"
        }
      ],
      "originalManifestSha256": "afed8ce2ba4d1cf36689ea49193e3ca236fbba5e83dd5a1cde7e84f355af8ee6"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "etcl-05-reasons-and-decisions",
      "manifestSha256": "4572f9c750337501c7cb4a3ee9e60a0aaa4d9e7a2a9058fda04c78d9710360cf",
      "entries": [
        {
          "phraseIndex": 0,
          "en": "I wanted an app that fit the way I like to learn.",
          "ja": "自分の好きな学び方に合うアプリが欲しかったんです。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-05-reasons-and-decisions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-001.mp3",
          "size": 70656,
          "sha256": "df341182cbdf43bad7e1a72cdb2e0da9d89e155c1f079ddfad92e58da8a37243"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 1,
          "en": "I couldn't find one that worked exactly the way I wanted, so I decided to build my own.",
          "ja": "自分の希望どおりに動くものが見つからなかったので、自分で作ることにしました。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-05-reasons-and-decisions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-002.mp3",
          "size": 101760,
          "sha256": "b024a1ccc647ca93e8c8111ba74fdb6c309c8ee883e808c806f44e380cb46f3b"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 2,
          "en": "I wanted to practice phrases based on situations I'm likely to encounter in real life.",
          "ja": "実生活で遭遇しそうな状況に基づいたフレーズを練習したかったんです。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-05-reasons-and-decisions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-003.mp3",
          "size": 91392,
          "sha256": "28248116794eec8df18db149370ce100517cc36cc7730cd0763f74927c8b740d"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 3,
          "en": "I also thought it would be a good opportunity to improve my programming skills.",
          "ja": "プログラミングのスキルを伸ばす良い機会にもなると思いました。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-05-reasons-and-decisions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-004.mp3",
          "size": 89856,
          "sha256": "ea16e969a3a9e4b0c7613c722ab181a94b1eab2b1c0d28b82a85edb83f5d5d96"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 4,
          "en": "It fits naturally into my daily routine.",
          "ja": "それは私の日常生活に無理なく取り入れられます。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-05-reasons-and-decisions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-005.mp3",
          "size": 89856,
          "sha256": "ade2bc177fe4ef960666b22f71467cdf62889f3b0ef1e71a7c8417f6e6687e1b"
        }
      ],
      "originalManifestSha256": "e72684b71f23320a88d79263c03f123296149b56dacba9bef6feb600300cb8a9"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "etcl-06-preferences-and-priorities",
      "manifestSha256": "7ef2e2548d3a2e0a2a601d530564555e22a3315e9399581061f2f3a0aa7b81a3",
      "entries": [
        {
          "phraseIndex": 0,
          "en": "I prefer working on my own schedule.",
          "ja": "私は自分のスケジュールで働く方が好きです。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-06-preferences-and-priorities/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-001.mp3",
          "size": 67968,
          "sha256": "3c34743d6e0e2f9aeac19efe056880c9268af298ad724eeeeb6696de9fd0f911"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 1,
          "en": "I want to earn enough money while still having time to work on my own apps.",
          "ja": "自分のアプリに取り組む時間を確保しながら、十分な収入も得たいです。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-06-preferences-and-priorities/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-002.mp3",
          "size": 97920,
          "sha256": "8c0c9b3e64a6d276e97d239d928a09676764b15831e37ac9e94fa0e94065ae22"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 2,
          "en": "I'm trying to find a balance between work and my own projects.",
          "ja": "仕事と自分のプロジェクトのバランスを取ろうとしています。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-06-preferences-and-priorities/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-003.mp3",
          "size": 69888,
          "sha256": "84efd0b8a4c3319e9b80ebfcd2e744500bb4efc95dab770ce56c05f18f0f1d34"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 3,
          "en": "What matters most to me is having enough time to work on my own projects.",
          "ja": "私にとって最も大切なのは、自分のプロジェクトに取り組む時間を十分に確保することです。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-06-preferences-and-priorities/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-004.mp3",
          "size": 140160,
          "sha256": "ecb92b213b461f3bd48dd6008c4a1f8bd2178010d269a6c53fcee975a2260299"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 4,
          "en": "My long-term goal is to make app development my main source of income.",
          "ja": "長期的な目標は、アプリ開発を主な収入源にすることです。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-06-preferences-and-priorities/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-005.mp3",
          "size": 83328,
          "sha256": "9883f61c3bbf8991b14aeb435821c230b62948feaf2394ccf594c974b72d98fb"
        }
      ],
      "originalManifestSha256": "f6d02049e73bf930466299d1ca91638499348260237152cae4e4d40b4fbf79ff"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "etcl-07-asking-questions",
      "manifestSha256": "faf709e4f6d3ea46b4c2d58e0168e3ba540825df13ae45fdf5faca355bb63d4f",
      "entries": [
        {
          "phraseIndex": 0,
          "en": "What do you mean by that?",
          "ja": "それはどういう意味ですか？",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-07-asking-questions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-001.mp3",
          "size": 41856,
          "sha256": "b7d67053e756629b74c752be32b648a146869db9d641b80353e1dfc23bb9a54f"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 1,
          "en": "How did you get into that?",
          "ja": "どういうきっかけでそれを始めたんですか？",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-07-asking-questions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-002.mp3",
          "size": 64128,
          "sha256": "97438cdc85bbcdcdb827f90d2ca0f5b5fd9aec914f95e1ab4151d0f2d19394cb"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 2,
          "en": "How's it going so far?",
          "ja": "今のところ、どんな調子ですか？",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-07-asking-questions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-003.mp3",
          "size": 44928,
          "sha256": "b6a75ec6e296ba406a25897772e87d1149d5ecef13ea72e819737a8cc5e48795"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 3,
          "en": "What do you find most challenging?",
          "ja": "何が一番難しいと感じますか？",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-07-asking-questions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-004.mp3",
          "size": 64896,
          "sha256": "7ceaecc8b0ef101985915e64b8176078c3bfa0b83ee0ca471b1c5eb432ba0964"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 4,
          "en": "Could you tell me a bit more about that?",
          "ja": "それについてもう少し詳しく教えてもらえますか？",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-07-asking-questions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-005.mp3",
          "size": 76800,
          "sha256": "8f9200fd38b9b969e77e986f8239eb9e530f012a3a7b3625e3d83b6d85ac87f7"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 5,
          "en": "Are you enjoying it?",
          "ja": "それを楽しんでいますか？",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-07-asking-questions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-006.mp3",
          "size": 38400,
          "sha256": "d831c86cdbcba8c4b8220c3cb9da4ac30ea8f1498d29a49b2607b8f10bc413da"
        }
      ],
      "originalManifestSha256": "59a761f750a1d407743c69be005df03f693552c32ba49a32baf2eaf760b68a74"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "etcl-08-responding-naturally",
      "manifestSha256": "5371218e367a0fe58b712764dd14e73f5ec89082e1aab92ea737aa5f4e9c0bb3",
      "entries": [
