    },
    {
      "lessonId": "etcl-12-expressing-opinions",
      "manifestSha256": "356d532c81aeb9eee9962daa803779f10c59e4d7f3b7e7a3789d0315498ca49d",
      "entries": [
        {
          "phraseIndex": 0,
          "en": "I think AI is a really useful tool for learning.",
          "ja": "AIは学習にとても役立つツールだと思います。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-12-expressing-opinions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-001.mp3",
          "size": 73728,
          "sha256": "1921dff0c5d060d388d1f34a8b4af7663ba6a033bcf7c169c943a55edb5b4c91"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 1,
          "en": "The main reason is that I can get explanations whenever I need them.",
          "ja": "一番の理由は、必要なときにいつでも説明を受けられることです。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-12-expressing-opinions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-002.mp3",
          "size": 90624,
          "sha256": "31b22e400fe0ff35adf0d0db899c36d3da4e597c6115551a45f61efd96dad1f5"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 2,
          "en": "I think relying too much on AI can be a problem.",
          "ja": "AIに頼りすぎるのは問題になり得ると思います。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-12-expressing-opinions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-003.mp3",
          "size": 72960,
          "sha256": "f131d3fcaa14c6e6c813065524192c410f7bcc8402842f39cfb5bad898776321"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 3,
          "en": "Not necessarily. It depends on how you use it.",
          "ja": "必ずしもそうではありません。使い方次第です。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-12-expressing-opinions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-004.mp3",
          "size": 79488,
          "sha256": "75006adfbcc335873877c99d7647c9f1c4898907b4f21d5bd89f110b0e52b4ef"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 4,
          "en": "It's important to think for yourself instead of just accepting what AI tells you.",
          "ja": "AIが言うことをそのまま受け入れるのではなく、自分で考えることが大切です。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-12-expressing-opinions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-005.mp3",
          "size": 104064,
          "sha256": "8298dc6119cd46aee9b8ae19fc6e42d499ce5b56af4924bc038d36dfb7e90b3b"
        },
        {
          "phraseIndex": 5,
          "en": "AI works best when it supports your learning rather than replacing your own thinking.",
          "ja": "AIは、自分で考えることの代わりにするのではなく、学習を支えるために使うと最も効果的です。",
          "path": "lessons/etcl-12-expressing-opinions/japanese-cues-v2/phrase-006.mp3",
          "size": 128256,
          "sha256": "d29030086bb630ffef7cc48460cedebd3ebb5e79fa33754ddb3b6447fd76994c"
        }
      ],
      "originalManifestSha256": "2e226d5ee82af0ce6c1c64041a5e4b4e4ffc522b6e00105db1759760f08b4b97"
    }
  ]
